The same sender, every day, ignoring unsubscribe.

5
00:00:14.225 --> 00:00:17.041
Blocking them in the admin portal takes an expert.

6
00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:19.141
Silence teaches them nothing.

7
00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:21.731
And a careless bounce can be turned against you.

8
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:25.199
This is MailBlock.

9
00:00:25.549 --> 00:00:27.575
Type a sender, or a whole domain.

10
