It is blocked across your entire mail system, in seconds.

12
00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:35.260
Press remove, and it is unblocked just as fast.

13
00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.756
Everything is inside one private page.

14
00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:44.373
A smart bounce, a silent quarantine, an attempt tracker and a status check.

15
00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:50.269
A post-quantum secure connection, automatic sync with Exchange, backups for every change,

16
00:00:50.619 --> 00:00:52.945
and it starts by itself, every time.

17
00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:56.816
Here is what makes it smart.

18
00:00:57.166 --> 00:01:00.878
When a blocked sender writes, MailBlock checks one thing: is it really them?

19
00:01:01.228 --> 00:01:04.065
Genuine senders get a polite bounce, so they stop.

20
00:01:04.415 --> 00:01:08.234
Forgeries get silence, so no one can use your company as a weapon.

21
00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:12.287
This is what a blocked sender sees.

22
00:01:12.637 --> 00:01:15.986
Polite, final, and generic. Nothing an attacker can use.

23
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.063
And you always know who keeps trying.

24
00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.122
Every blocked sender shows how many attempts, and when.

25
00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:28.037
One click shows whether anyone's latest email arrived, bounced, or is being held.

26
00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:31.852
It is secure by design.

27
00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:34.399
Private, running inside your business.

28
